From 6370081bb68dd119a6f833cb3227402b83cee738 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: plotarmordev <299844489+plotarmordev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:17:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/30] build: Drama 3 backbone and tower kernels, the drama
 module, the native host and their tool steps

Embeds the backbone and tower fatbins, adds the drama module to the native server and its host tests, and a build
step per backbone and tower oracle, replay and trace driver. The codec's kernels and tools follow on their own.
---
 zig/build/cuda.zig       | 168 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 zig/src/cuda/kernels.zig |   3 +
 2 files changed, 160 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

